Package: mybaby
Version: __VERSION__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Vladimir Yuyukin <viorn89@yandex.ru>
Depends: systemd | systemd-tmpfiles
Description: Minimalist baby sleep tracker
 Simple web application to track baby sleep: start/stop timer,
 sleep journal with editing, notes and CSV/JSON export.
 Runs as a systemd service (default port 8080), stores data in
 /var/lib/mybaby/sleep.db.
